  "steps": [
   "Heat the oil in a large saucepan over a medium heat. Add the leeks with a pinch of the salt and cook for 6 minutes, until soft. Peel and chop the parsnips meanwhile.",
   "Stir in the garlic and thyme leaves for 1 minute, then add the parsnips, lentils, bay leaves and stock.",
   "Bring to the boil, cover and simmer for 25 minutes, until the lentils are tender but hold their shape and the parsnips are soft.",
   "Stir in the cavolo nero and cook uncovered for 5 minutes, until tender. Add a splash of water if it looks dry.",
